From a5b11dbdcdc8a2b83fdc49b6c68bcc96c23142a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:58:42 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: menu text as game messages, icon highlight follows the
 choice

The arena menus' text is now messages (MsgArena*, appended to text/en.po), so
it draws in the game's own font and wraps as the shops' lines do. The prompt is
a message window shown as Shop_ShowKeeperMessage shows one, and the icon row
runs through IconMenu_Run, so the highlighted icon follows the selection. The
icon labels are consecutive messages, as IconMenu_Center takes them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
